Embedded adult-text Bayesian scorer data notice

The curated, high-weight adult vocabulary (scripts/text_bayes_curated.json)
is drawn from concepts present in the English
LDNOOBW/List-of-Dirty-Naughty-Obscene-and-Otherwise-Bad-Words project:

  https://github.com/LDNOOBW/List-of-Dirty-Naughty-Obscene-and-Otherwise-Bad-Words

That project is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International (CC-BY-4.0) and is copyrighted by Shutterstock, Inc.

The e2guardian and Redwood pornography lists named in the implementation
plan were reviewed as references only. Their raw data is not embedded in
this package by default because redistribution compatibility was not
confirmed for this project.

Since model version 2, model_data.json also carries every entry of the
multilingual LDNOOBW lists vendored in internal/classify/profanity/words
(same project, same CC-BY-4.0 licence, snapshot commit recorded in that
package's NOTICE) as low-weight features. See
scripts/build_text_bayes_model.go for the weighting rationale.
